  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop a partnership to provide sharing of different practices regarding maternal, infant and family health to work for a sustainable development of better health and lower mortality in Norway and Brazil.  
 This project will facilitate the exchange of healthcare professionals, academic staff and  midwifery- and nursing students between Norway and Brazil. The project aims to raise awareness and share knowledge on global challenges related to maternal and neonatal health, and to provide participants with knowledge and skills through work experience. Furthermore, through knowledge exchange and various activities the project aims to empower women, especially those from minority and vulnerable groups in pregnancy, childbirth and early motherhood to improve the health of the women and their infants.</narrative>
  </description>
